# Cliderness creature definitions
#
# kind       animal / monster / npc
# aggression never / defensive (fights back) / night (hostile in the dark) / always
# activity   day / night / any  (when the creature is awake)
# habitat    surface / cave / water
# hp, damage, defense  integers; speed = ticks per step (lower is faster)
# attack_cd  ticks between attacks; sight / hearing in cells
# flee_pct   flees below this % of max hp; weight = spawn weight
# group      min-max spawned together; xp = skill xp for the killer
# effect     status effect inflicted on hit with effect_chance %
# burns=1    takes damage in daylight; biomes = surface biome ids (empty = any)
# trade      NPC offers: in_item:count>out_item:count (up to 3)
#
# [loot id] sections: item=min-max:chance%

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- animals

